      "section_id": "18.05",
      "source_text": "While moving: Set up each model in your unit: - Wholly within the set-up distance of that TRANSPORT, and as close as possible to that TRANSPORT. - Or: If the above is not possible while remaining unengaged, set up that model wholly within the set-up distance of that TRANSPORT, as close as possible to that TRANSPORT, and engaged. Each model that still cannot be set up is destroyed.",
